<item>
<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-22T22:33:00.272Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 22:33:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican authorities have arrested five suspects in the Vizsla silver mining murders, including a man known as El Talibán, and a Texas man was indicted by a federal grand jury for a weapons conspiracy linked to the Sinaloa Cartel. A transporter for the Sinaloa Cartel pleaded guilty to trafficking methamphetamine and marijuana, while another smuggler admitted moving tens of thousands of pounds of drugs in federal court. Mexico’s AI-powered intel platform is now hunting the next cartel boss after reports that El Mencho is dead. The United States has restricted airspace and drone flights along the Mexican border to counter cartel drone traffic. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WBFF&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNV05acDJ3WW5XYTF0WHhMOTZmMkhYcmxlazR0TjNFeHRSRFdxZzNoUlBUY2lCQkJsMENDaEZuR3FBVDBlM2trZDluRFdHN3J1SHFpUk9icU5GbzRPTkY1cHd4emUtbjJ3OEYzeEVaeG9xWkcwRkdDLWMzNjdtQWZzR2hVbEpYSmtjaEVLemNubkJ6b3RPZ1FQT3lZMEplOEU?oc=5&quot;&gt;inkl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hill&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNOXRKSFJMTU9wLTZwTXZ5QkEwQUo3bUpsVm1pVkJDVkRjOWlXMmVxRlB3S2w0MlgwMlN2SHdwREJYOWxITDNaX1JyaW5CRmFFeTRpaDhHa2ltMmJuOW0zZFh4ZWRFY0UwdTZmSXVHUzdxR0pjY25tYVFtZ0Yzd3Eza2xEZmJFMTVSRGwtUVcwR2YyUTJaMHVPVWR2UkRHYTdUY3NzaFZzTDFaODdTYlFNNFB3?oc=5&quot;&gt;New York Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxON0p1aW53cXRHeUhrOHp4OUVGVkNodkFUNHlkQlp4NmNvcy1EYUNvLThfU3B4aGNFZWNqbHlRMmRlVlhESnJiREZmRU9aWEFyVHpER0I3dDZuODlmaWxkaXFoeXpoYmwteFRYbm1yQm92YTkwTUNwVGZoNjIzbXNLUlQwZHBmaUpnLWdIckNHQ1owOVBlcjBiTDdZZUs0M3I2NGhFR